{'symbol': 'SWKS', 'date': '2023-01-10 08:01:00', 'title': 'SKYWORKS AND SEMTECH LAUNCH GROUND-BREAKING LPWAN REFERENCE DESIGN FOR INDUSTRIAL AND SMART CITY APPLICATIONS', 'text': "IRVINE, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SKYWORKS SOLUTIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: SWKS) AND SEMTECH CORPORATION (NASDAQ: SMTC) TODAY INTRODUCED THE SKY66423-SX1261 REFERENCE DESIGN FOR LOW-POWER WIDE-AREA NETWORKS (LPWAN). THE SKY66423-SX1261 COMBINES SEMTECH'S LORA® CONNECT™ SX1261 TRANSCEIVER WITH SKYWORKS' SKY66423 FRONT-END MODULE (FEM) FOR USE IN A VARIETY OF INDUSTRIAL AND SMART CITY APPLICATIONS."}